  "details": "- CVE-2026-11861: validate the PAC of cross-realm trust tickets in the KDB driver, including ID override checks\n- CVE-2026-13097: enforce Kerberos principal name uniqueness with a principal-aware matching rule (new ipa-krbprinc-mr 389-ds plugin)\n- CVE-2026-18147: remove the arbitrary URL redirect from the Web UI password reset page\n- CVE-2026-19550: require write access to the trust entry before refreshing trust domains\n- do not fail ipa-server or ipa-server-trust-ad removal on hosts without a running systemd,\n  such as container images: the dbus and oddjobd reload calls in the install and removal\n  scriptlets now tolerate failure, like the stop, disable and condrestart calls beside them",
